[I] The base for a GNUstep system

[T] The GNUstep Base Library is a library of general-purpose, non-graphical
[T] Objective-C objects such as strings, collections, streams,
[T] notifications, distributed objects and event loops. It implements the
[T] non-graphical portion of Apple's Cocoa frameworks (Foundation), which
[T] came from the OpenStep standard.

[U] https://www.gnustep.org/

[A] The GNUstep Project
